var e=[{key:`scryde-game`,name:`Scryde Game`,description:`Dark Lineage-style cabinet with cinematic background art, amber action accents, red PvP highlights and glass game panels.`,tags:[`MMORPG`,`Scryde style`,`cinematic`],preview:`Adds a full-screen game background, video hero layer, compact glass navigation, gold buttons and dense server-account cards.`},{key:`aurora-glass`,name:`Aurora Glass`,description:`Transparent cabinet with frosted glass panels, cursor-driven parallax, flowing glow, readable typography and polished curved surfaces in light or dark mode.`,tags:[`light`,`dark`,`glass`,`parallax`],preview:`Turns the cabinet into an airy glass interface with animated aurora layers, soft reflection highlights, clear text contrast and bright or midnight palettes.`},{key:`modern-game-launcher`,name:`Modern Game Launcher`,description:`Dark fantasy MMORPG cabinet with WebGL rune particles, parallax citadel art, launcher navigation, metal panels, gold frames and red-amber magic lighting.`,tags:[`MMORPG`,`WebGL`,`launcher`],preview:`Transforms the personal cabinet into a modern fantasy launcher: animated WebGL ambience, cinematic background, glowing header, RPG sidebar and stone-metal UI controls.`},{key:`lineage2-fantasy`,name:`Lineage 2 Fantasy`,description:`Тёмное фэнтези окно в духе Lineage 2 с бронзой, золотом и тяжёлыми панелями.`,tags:[`новый skin`,`Lineage 2`,`атмосферный`],preview:`Кабинет получает тёмные панели, золотые акценты, узкие кнопки и отдельный характер.`},{key:`classic`,name:`Classic Cabinet`,description:`Спокойный базовый шаблон для привычного личного кабинета.`,tags:[`базовый`,`читаемый`,`официальный`],preview:`Классическая структура, которую удобно развивать и менять по цветам.`},{key:`dark-royal`,name:`Dark Royal Gothic`,description:`Самостоятельный тёмно-готический кабинет в духе Lineage 2: замковый интерфейс, геральдическое золото, кровавые акценты и мистические панели.`,tags:[`новый skin`,`dark fantasy`,`gothic`],preview:`Добавляет готический sidebar с аватаром лорда, HP/MP/EXP шкалы, золотые кнопки, пергаментные поля, карточки с углами, таблицы и модальные окна в стиле MMORPG.`},{key:`dark-fantasy-mmorpg`,name:`Dark Fantasy MMORPG`,description:`Эпический игровой шаблон личного кабинета: камень, кованое железо, багровая магия, тёмно-синие тени, рунические панели и UI в стиле MMORPG.`,tags:[`MMORPG`,`dark fantasy`,`инвентарь`],preview:`Преображает кабинет в игровой интерфейс: аватар в фэнтези-рамке, навигация-свиток, каменные карточки статистики, RPG-инвентарь склада и геральдические бейджи достижений.`}],t=[`dark`],n={"scryde-game":[`dark`],"aurora-glass":[`light`,`dark`],"modern-game-launcher":[`dark`],"lineage2-fantasy":[`dark`],classic:[`light`,`dark`],"dark-royal":[`dark`],"dark-fantasy-mmorpg":[`dark`,`light`]},r={"scryde-game":[],"aurora-glass":[{key:`prism-day`,name:`Prism Day`,description:`Clear glass, soft daylight, cyan reflections, coral warmth and ink-blue text.`,preview:`A bright default palette with readable translucent panels and animated ambient glow.`},{key:`mint-lagoon`,name:`Mint Lagoon`,description:`Fresh mint, aqua light, white glass cards and restrained navy contrast.`,preview:`A cooler variation for clean server cabinets with a calm transparent surface.`},{key:`sunrise-opal`,name:`Sunrise Opal`,description:`Warm pearl glass with peach highlights, gold edges and soft teal shadows.`,preview:`A warmer opal variant that keeps the template light while adding a premium glow.`}],"modern-game-launcher":[{key:`blood-citadel`,name:`Blood Citadel`,description:`Black stone, burgundy shadows, red siege glow and old gold launcher controls.`,preview:`The main dark fantasy launcher palette for PvP and siege-focused cabinets.`},{key:`ember-vault`,name:`Ember Vault`,description:`Warmer amber light, bronze edges and molten magic over deep graphite panels.`,preview:`A brighter forge-like variant with stronger gold highlights and readable panels.`},{key:`arcane-night`,name:`Arcane Night`,description:`Cooler blue arcane sparks mixed with dark metal, blood accents and restrained gold.`,preview:`Adds a colder magical tone while keeping the MMORPG launcher structure.`}],"lineage2-fantasy":[],classic:[],"dark-royal":[],"dark-fantasy-mmorpg":[{key:`obsidian-keep`,name:`Obsidian Keep`,description:`Base dark fortress palette with obsidian, forged iron, old gold and crimson magic.`,preview:`Universal MMORPG palette for a dark fantasy interface.`},{key:`blood-moon`,name:`Blood Moon`,description:`Crimson moon glow, dark steel and copper frames.`,preview:`Fits aggressive PvP, siege and dark clan themes.`},{key:`frost-rune`,name:`Frost Rune`,description:`Ice runes, cold metal, deep blue background and silver-blue accents.`,preview:`A colder magical skin for northern or arcane server atmospheres.`},{key:`elderwood`,name:`Elderwood`,description:`Ancient forest, dark leather, carved wood, emerald glow and bronze details.`,preview:`Softer and warmer than the base theme while keeping the fantasy character.`},{key:`void-arcane`,name:`Void Arcane`,description:`Void magic with violet runes, black stone and cold glow.`,preview:`The most magical palette with stronger mysticism and deeper shadows.`}]},i=e=>r[e]??[],a=e=>n[e]??t,o=e=>a(e)[0]??`dark`,s=(e,t)=>a(e).includes(t);export{s as a,o as i,i as n,a as r,e as t};